+# G6-2 / T4 fixture provenance (see ARCH-DESIGN section 6, T3 and T4).
+# Two verbatim cost rows that MUST agree. The selftest asserts that the fixture
+# testdata/fixtures/g6-2-cost-clauses.md contains both lines verbatim.
+#
+# Line 1 = `git show HEAD:docs/DELIVERY_DIRECTIVE.md` line 47 (section 0.3 changelog,
+#          v1.9 row): budget clause ⑥×1 + ⑦×1 (exempt) plus realized clause
+#          ⑥×1 + ⑦×2 = 3 (compared). This is the state written by commit 9f68a52.
+# Line 2 = `git show b738e6b:docs/DELIVERY_DIRECTIVE.md` line 927 (appendix C.0e cost
+#          row): realized clause ⑥×1 + ⑦×2 = 3 plus the historic budget declaration.
+# Both carry slice key SW-5, so G6-2 compares them; they agree => PASS.
+# The pre-fix pairing (commit b738e6b: the section 0.3 v1.9 row still reads the bare
